# Dark Legacy (bastok 57, DRK AF1): Raibaht and Mighty Fist in the Metalworks, Cochal-Monchal in Windurst Waters, Quu
# Bokye, the qm1 and Vaa Huja the Erudite in Giddeus. The guard (main job DRK, main level AF1_QUEST_LEVEL 40), the offer
# 751, Mighty Fist's 752 (the Letter from the Darksteel Forge, Prog 1), Cochal-Monchal's 697 (the letter deleted, Prog 2)
# and 698, Quu Bokye's 61 and his cherry trade 62 (the cherry taken, Option 1), a Yagudo Cherry at the qm1 (Vaa Huja
# popped and claimed, SENSE_OF_FOREBODING), the kill (Prog 3), the qm1's Darksteel Formula, Cochal-Monchal's 699, Mighty
# Fist's 754, Raibaht's 755 and the reward (Raven Scythe, fame +20, the formula deleted).
# Defaults: Raibaht 501 (DefaultActions), Cochal-Monchal 696, Quu Bokye 56, the qm1 NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. Mighty Fist
# has his own script (561 until its finish sets his local var spokenMetalFist, 560 after); the lookup alternates an
# Event-priority quest action (754) with it, while a Progress one (752) always wins.
# Shared NPCs this char never meets: Raibaht (Teak Me to the Stars from Bastok fame level 3, The Usual with the
# invitation, LB04), Mighty Fist (The Darksmith from fame level 3), Quu Bokye (The Lost Book, Early Bird Catches the
# Bookworm). The char has Bastok fame 0.
lists Metalworks/Raibaht/onTrigger Metalworks/Raibaht/onTrade Metalworks/Mighty_Fist/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/751 Metalworks/onEventFinish/752 Metalworks/onEventFinish/755 WindurstWaters/Cochal-Monchal/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/697 Giddeus/qm1/onTrigger Giddeus/qm1/onTrade Giddeus/Quu_Bokye/onTrigger Giddeus/Quu_Bokye/onTrade Giddeus/Vaa_Huja_the_Erudite/onMobDeath Giddeus/onEventFinish/62
char zone=Metalworks pos=-26.3,-10,-2.1 job=DRK lvl=40
item YagudoCherry x4
item BoneChip
login
trade Raibaht BoneChip x1            # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Mighty_Fist                  # available: no handler of this quest at Mighty Fist; his script, 561
finish                               # his script: spokenMetalFist 1
trigger Raibaht                      # DRK 40: the offer, 751
finish                               # accepted
trigger Raibaht                      # accepted, no formula: nil, his default 501
finish-if-event
trigger Mighty_Fist                  # Prog 0: 752 (Progress priority: over his script)
finish                               # KI Letter from the Darksteel Forge, Prog 1
trigger Mighty_Fist                  # Prog 1, no formula: nil; his script, 560
finish-if-event
warp -50.9,-6.25,109.3 WindurstWaters
trigger Cochal-Monchal               # Prog 1: 697
finish                               # the letter deleted, Prog 2
trigger Cochal-Monchal               # Prog 2: 698
finish
warp -160,17,180 Giddeus
trigger Quu_Bokye                    # Prog 2: 61
finish
trade Quu_Bokye BoneChip x1          # the wrong item: nil, nothing
trade Quu_Bokye YagudoCherry x1      # Prog 2, Option 0, one cherry: 62
finish                               # the cherry taken (tradeComplete), Option 1
trade Quu_Bokye YagudoCherry x1      # Option 1: nil, nothing (the cherry kept)
warp -60,-3.7,-446.5 Giddeus
trigger qm1                          # Prog 2: nil, NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
finish-if-event
trade qm1 BoneChip x1                # Prog 2, the wrong item: nil, nothing
trade qm1 YagudoCherry x1            # Prog 2, Vaa Huja not up: the cherry taken, Vaa Huja popped and claimed, SENSE_OF_FOREBODING
trade qm1 YagudoCherry x1            # Vaa Huja up: nil, nothing (the cherry kept)
kill VAA_HUJA_THE_ERUDITE            # Prog 2: Prog 3
trade qm1 YagudoCherry x1            # Prog 3: nil, nothing
trigger qm1                          # Prog 3, no formula: KI Darksteel Formula
finish-if-event
trigger qm1                          # the formula held: nil, NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
finish-if-event
warp -160,17,180 Giddeus
trigger Quu_Bokye                    # Prog 3: nil, his default 56
finish-if-event
trade Quu_Bokye YagudoCherry x1      # Prog 3: nil, nothing
warp -50.9,-6.25,109.3 WindurstWaters
trigger Cochal-Monchal               # Prog 3, the formula: 699
finish
warp -45.2,2.777,-31.2 Metalworks
trigger Mighty_Fist                  # the formula: 754 (Event priority, the lookup's first turn)
finish-if-event
trigger Mighty_Fist                  # the lookup alternates: his script, 561 (spokenMetalFist is a local var, lost with the zone changes)
finish-if-event
trigger Raibaht                      # the formula: 755
finish                               # completed: Raven Scythe, fame +20, the formula deleted
trigger Raibaht                      # completed: no handler, 501
finish-if-event
trade Raibaht BoneChip x1            # completed: nothing
